# {{projectName}} — Cursor Rules (Monorepo)

## BLOCKING Rules
1. No `any` type — use `unknown` + type guards
2. No direct DB calls from apps — use `@repo/client` hooks
3. No business logic in components — extract to hooks or convex functions
4. Features in `features/{name}/` — vertical slices per app
5. Package boundaries — apps import from `@repo/*`, never from other apps
6. Convex validators required — `args` + `returns` on every query/mutation
7. Bounded reads — `.take(n)` or pagination
8. Index-backed queries — `.withIndex()`
9. Tests pass before merge — `turbo test && turbo typecheck`

## Structure
- `apps/web/` — Next.js (App Router, Turbopack)
- `apps/mobile/` — Expo (Expo Router, React Native)
- `packages/backend/` — Convex functions + schema
- `packages/client/` — Universal React hooks
- `packages/theme/` — Design tokens
- `packages/shared/` — Shared types + utils

## Package Graph
```
@repo/backend → @repo/client → apps/{web,mobile}
@repo/theme → apps/{web,mobile}
@repo/shared → all
```
